#: templates/base.html:114
msgid ""
"Data from the <a href=\"https://data.worldbank.org/\">World Bank</a>, the <a "
"href=\"https://www.imf.org/external/datamapper/\">IMF</a>, the <a "
"href=\"https://hdr.undp.org/\">UNDP</a>, <a "
"href=\"https://v-dem.net/\">V-Dem</a> via <a "
"href=\"https://ourworldindata.org/\">Our World in Data</a>, borders from <a "
"href=\"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/\">Natural Earth</a> and, for "
"1937–1945, <a href=\"https://icr.ethz.ch/data/cshapes/\">CShapes</a>. Every "
"chart and download names its source. The site's code is licensed under the "
"AGPL-3.0."
msgstr ""
