#: templates/politics/index.html:11
msgid "Settle family arguments with data. Or start new ones."
msgstr "Familienstreit mit Daten schlichten. Oder einen neuen anzetteln."

#: templates/politics/index.html:12
msgid ""
"Every metric we have for a country, coloured by who was in power. See how "
